            <staff xml:id="m-d681d82d-6dbd-4d4a-99cd-51ee37a8a48e" n="3">
              <layer xml:id="m-202c9da2-e603-4f38-b071-f8c28160b123" n="1">
                <syllable xml:id="m-7276899e-b908-42cd-8b16-e1a3885ef316">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-c6bdeaf2-e77c-4fed-b084-d117ed267e99" type="punctum" xml:id="m-b1f332c2-c7bb-4110-9c0b-b31833640cc2">
                    <nc xml:id="m-0a9ec796-801b-4434-ac77-86e6ea679cb4" pname="d" oct="4" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <custos xml:id="m-507b2c37-43fa-4713-95a6-0768cd8fbbad" facs="#m-b2042aa5-df14-4506-bc99-f0168d86b2b7" pname="d" oct="4" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-4d15a141-a3fc-4e90-8cb8-c9f3f37ba609">
              <lg xml:id="m-4d62584f-71e8-4426-a5d4-a79ebc5be0c7">
                <l xml:id="m-4fb94875-bc8d-418a-b9c4-c007cfc91f83" facs="#m-f2de95bd-71ec-4106-bc7c-9bc5ac3c8373" label="text-like">At Lauds</l><l xml:id="m-d46bc79a-0018-4d66-a452-3379bd87d86f" facs="#m-a21f83f3-9c6f-4352-9476-38d982c2ddee" label="ambiguous">685</l><l xml:id="m-d6f379c9-0dd5-41b2-848f-d8e662d69b2f" facs="#m-6ccfced1-b158-4a9d-b2b1-a742444d1353" label="lyrics-like">2. Quóniam dolóse égit in conspéctu éjus: * ut inveniátur</l><l xml:id="m-bd6f1efc-8099-406d-b373-15a334ee495a" facs="#m-2b6347a5-4c9f-4fff-8929-671f64897d5c" label="lyrics-like">iniquitas éjus ad ódium.</l><l xml:id="m-c999cada-def4-43e7-8f21-40a0b4bba219" facs="#m-8dbb0e5a-9163-4540-ab6e-6cdcf966c3d1" label="lyrics-like">3. Vérba óris éjus insquitas, et dólus: *nóluit intelligere ut</l><l xml:id="m-8cb41ad6-7bc0-485e-bc43-e560e5f0b5ac" facs="#m-5f7fb909-99ec-4e35-b0ba-e368322aa735" label="lyrics-like">bene ágeret.</l><l xml:id="m-d63d8ce2-a4fd-46f8-88a0-9f78684eb59e" facs="#m-6a3f43f3-034c-45cd-887e-bb3ed8194c95" label="lyrics-like">4. Iniquitátem meditátus est in cubsli súo: * ástitit ómni víae</l><l xml:id="m-f175c660-f99a-48ab-bfc0-ca184419e0ef" facs="#m-d944885d-1535-4866-90f9-36b25a0b8803" label="lyrics-like">non bónae, malitiam autem non-odivit.</l><l xml:id="m-f0f6d443-fb45-45b0-88b7-080f00a03dcd" facs="#m-779060e6-f525-4587-814d-4d421c261966" label="lyrics-like">5. Dómine, in caélo misericórdia túa:t véritas túa usque</l><l xml:id="m-024805fa-9aec-43c7-aeaf-59dc59ab2503" facs="#m-56f24074-58d8-4634-b7e8-217e246e9469" label="lyrics-like">ad núbes.</l><l xml:id="m-08c7c89f-073e-4bc3-adfa-206abbe6bfbf" facs="#m-fdf04525-ffcd-43a4-bdc3-1c47680ad975" label="lyrics-like">6. Justítia túa sicut móntes Déi: * judicia túa abýssus múlta.</l><l xml:id="m-a1619825-4304-45b6-b83b-11ce5ef6b44f" facs="#m-ae5101ee-e7ea-45cd-8973-d588d17ebec1" label="lyrics-like">7. Hómines. et iuménta salvábis, Dómine:“ quemádmodum</l><l xml:id="m-30dc7ab7-0b2e-44ab-83a7-f9c8bf7c9039" facs="#m-b42fdf53-f04b-4dfa-a1bc-f7d77834f515" label="lyrics-like">multiplicásti misericórdiam túam, Déus.</l><l xml:id="m-715ed3d2-7e07-41cd-bb06-085f9093fd4f" facs="#m-c3097f6b-8e58-4d0e-be68-7c9b1b4ccfa0" label="lyrics-like">8. Filii autem hóminum*in tégmine alárum tuárum spe¬</l><l xml:id="m-dcb3d7cb-35a5-4af9-b336-06afa276e0d4" facs="#m-4fc9d0f1-5087-4f78-b6a0-1b415a6703ec" label="lyrics-like">rábunt.</l><l xml:id="m-ff104450-0348-44d2-892b-f6654d31557c" facs="#m-9326b6c5-b0d4-48c6-9289-ca195df393eb" label="lyrics-like">9. Inebriabúntur ab ubertáte dómus túae: * et torrénte</l><l xml:id="m-67f50531-d853-49fc-8639-c74fb5cc2fe1" facs="#m-abbb3e2c-d2d7-4e61-8a71-74aed91286d7" label="lyrics-like">voluptátis túae potábis éos.</l><l xml:id="m-52ca8d70-ec45-4100-84b9-63229486c4dc" facs="#m-31e0349a-071e-4ea8-ae7e-6ec4906ed302" label="lyrics-like">10. Quóniam apud te est fons vitae: “ et in lúmine túo</l><l xml:id="m-0eddd76d-5379-420d-85d8-c8040b8679fb" facs="#m-bd20279c-e1cd-40cf-bd2f-bfd7e9133ccf" label="lyrics-like">vidébimus lúmen.</l><l xml:id="m-985ae144-5b76-4038-b71a-66e3bf40d5c4" facs="#m-e4b483fa-191f-4adf-860b-6ad239511b6a" label="lyrics-like">11. Praeténde misericórdiam túam sciéntibus te, “et justitiam</l><l xml:id="m-c7b35319-6e4d-42f5-a9bf-4de8e43c821b" facs="#m-5bcc2564-1488-4f90-b49d-60a0e23dc4f2" label="lyrics-like">túam his, qui récto sunt córde.</l><l xml:id="m-e8ce4499-8a39-490a-a3ae-c9420b4c9d9c" facs="#m-049edb22-4ee4-477e-82a9-fc7ad9052cd8" label="lyrics-like">12. Non véniat míhi pes supérbiae: * et mánus peccatóris non</l><l xml:id="m-2de019d3-054a-4fc8-bbb0-f2f75c0a0b80" facs="#m-f85d5d56-5948-47ad-b522-7c8574488d7c" label="lyrics-like">móveat me.</l><l xml:id="m-1a212061-9db0-400a-994d-c7e290930295" facs="#m-564cf06e-fa64-443f-9236-5fdd6ba180a2" label="lyrics-like">13. Ibi cecidérunt qui operántur iniquitátem: *xpulsi sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-91481e18-8cad-46ee-87fa-5c65f638619d" facs="#m-f334ffa6-c665-417b-8464-7304048aa248" label="lyrics-like">nec potuérunt stáre.</l><l xml:id="m-ab0a220b-7b58-4f34-9136-b311071c7031" facs="#m-239278a8-0f6b-4f64-8b47-300899739580" label="ambiguous">4 Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-6fce8e94-c741-460b-a55b-410f5d121bd9" facs="#m-2df60185-71da-440d-98fd-06bae595c296" label="ambiguous">14</l><l xml:id="m-591ad361-7cba-49b8-a1bd-6724695235f7" facs="#m-294059dd-55fe-418c-9316-7be68c52bed1" label="lyrics-like">Xhortá-tus es“ in virtú-te tú-a,</l><l xml:id="m-fccd8ac3-9e74-4df1-8b87-c38cc51117c0" facs="#m-73769371-5805-4b57-9f61-312311558e9e" label="lyrics-like">et in re-fecti-ó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d147df5d-26c7-4d88-8578-e89cab1a8b06" facs="#m-2fbf6272-0f58-4677-9f6e-e0d3387bf3e6" label="lyrics-like">ne sáncta tú-a, Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-059034d8-9660-4ccf-a483-32944f2a2fe2" facs="#m-ebbc1c86-83ba-47f9-8721-e48db2b71e5b" label="text-like">Canticle of Moses (New psalter, p. 39*)</l><l xml:id="m-687d3988-5bbd-4345-a842-e3964712b8fe" facs="#m-aa6a595f-0cb0-4826-a6da-182b021c71d5" label="ambiguous">Exod. 15, 1-19</l><l xml:id="m-564245ab-849d-49eb-a421-10fe30611977" facs="#m-c3c00d27-5a09-4ebc-94ac-9790df7dce84" label="lyrics-like">1. Cantémus Dómino: glo-ri-óse enim magni-fi-cá-tus est,</l><l xml:id="m-19d33619-ff17-480f-8f7d-af4691b1fb33" facs="#m-253c23ee-f7e9-4b7f-9a50-7f52a5ab8952" label="lyrics-like">équum et</l><l xml:id="m-433e4b76-f1c5-4693-b313-700c5c7b915a" facs="#m-c0f12f2e-d833-46b6-80bd-fb0f6e58fa8b" label="lyrics-like">ascensórem de-jé-cit in má¬ re. Flex: pu¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>